    "id": "tender_496876/1522135",
    "title": "PS25156 -  Cyber Accelerator Programme Work Packages",
    "description": "***** THIS IS AN AWARD NOTICE, NOT A CALL FOR COMPETITION *****\r\n\r\nThis procurement is being concluded following a mini competition under RM6126 Research & Insights DPS Framework\r\n\r\nBrief Description of Requirement\r\nThe new Cyber Accelerator Programme will build upon the success of Cyber Runway to help DSIT achieve in these areas. The Cyber Accelerator Programme will provide a multi-strand programme to British cyber entrepreneurs as they commercialise new products and make UK businesses and citizens safer and time richer. At the core of the Cyber Accelerator programme is a recognition of the importance of growth and resilience. Specifically, the resilience of the UK and the resilience of Emerging Tech.",
